Format Use Case <code>mp3_44100_128</code> General purpose <code>mp3_44100_192</code> Higher quality <code>pcm_16000</code> Real-time, low latency <code>pcm_44100</code> Real-time, high quality <code>ulaw_8000</code> Telephony (Twilio) <pre><code>config := omnivoice.SynthesisConfig{
